module tasks.`2026-11-25-landing-fixture-hang-guard`

task LandingFixtureHangGuard {
  title "test-landing fixture timeouts are hang guards, not speed checks"
  verify $ make test-landing
  paths "scripts/test-landing.py"
  brief """
    Our stand: subtract before you add; report what you removed.

    ## Evidence
    Full `make test` on `7d722969a` (Oracle Term Oracle, 2026-11-25, log `~/mydev/bboxy450-term-oracle-ci/target/ci-local.log:88-120`) failed only at `ConsolidatedIntegrationTests.test_make_land_rejects_an_empty_module_even_when_another_runs`: `subprocess.TimeoutExpired: Command ['make', 'land'] timed out after 45 seconds` (`scripts/test-landing.py:800-801`). Under load it ran 54 s; alone it passed in 12.4 s and 14.1 s (2/2). The 45 s limit measures machine load, not behavior.

    ## Do
    1. In `scripts/test-landing.py`, every fixture subprocess `timeout=45` (lines 801, 1007, 3589, 3638, 3651 on `7d722969a`; re-grep on current main) is a hang guard. Replace them with one named module constant of 300 s (nextest's hang limit), with a one-line comment saying it guards hangs and is not a speed assertion. Change no other timing.
    2. `make test-landing` green, then `make land`.


    ## Report from seat:01M8A0BZTA1Y6363Z5QY0JR5YW

    Landed the signed five-minute fixture hang guard on main. `make test-landing` exited 0 with 259 fixtures passing, including the previously failing empty-module case in 8.479 s. One documented constant replaces five inline 45-second deadlines. The AST check and `git diff --check` exited 0, and `make land` exited 0. The worktree is clean.

    ```json
    {
      "op_id": "01M8A0MW8AN6CZ7NP89TFE63GB",
      "commit": "7dac1786c755e8cecd745c92957d067df4507c8c",
      "report": "[[reports/2026-11-25-landing-fixture-hang-guard.den]]",
      "verify_result": {
        "command": "make test-landing",
        "exit_code": 0,
        "evidence": [
          {
            "criterion": "Five fixture subprocesses use one 300-second hang guard, with every other timing preserved",
            "reference": "scripts/test-landing.py:35, 804, 1010, 3592, 3641, 3654. AST comparison against the parent exited 0."
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Targeted fixture suite passes",
            "reference": "make test-landing exited 0. Ran 259 fixture tests in 153.337 s, failures=0. The empty-module rejection case passed in 8.479 s."
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Land the verified change",
            "reference": "make land exited 0 and printed LANDED 7dac1786c755e8cecd745c92957d067df4507c8c. origin/main matched HEAD and git verify-commit HEAD exited 0."
          }
        ]
      }
    }
    ```
    """

